# Editor and hand-made backup copies. A stray *.bak file shows up in `git status`
# as untracked and reads exactly like somebody's unsaved work — that mistake cost
# six days of a work-board row (2026-08-27 .. 2026-09-02). Backups belong in git
# history, not next to the file.
*.bak
*.bak-*
*.orig
*~

node_modules/
.DS_Store
